Description: Python library for JOSE RFCs - JWS, JWE, JWK, JWA, JWT
 joserfc implements the JOSE family of specifications: JSON Web Signature
 (JWS), JSON Web Encryption (JWE), JSON Web Key (JWK), JSON Web Algorithms
 (JWA) and JSON Web Token (JWT).
 .
 This build deliberately tracks upstream 1.5.0, the release that added the
 RFC 9864 Ed25519 and Ed448 signature algorithms required by the FastMCP
 JWT authentication provider. Upstream 1.6.0 and later require
 cryptography >= 45.0.1, which is newer than the version available in the
 distribution archive, so bumping further would pull in a rebuild of a
 core cryptographic package.
 .
 This package provides the Python 3 library.
